@3000 =~Z's PF Spell Notes - Battering Blast~
@3001 =~This book collects the notes of a wizard known only as Z on the force spell "Battering Blast". If you wish, you may learn them.

"One of the most promising and broadly useful damage spells. Mind the spell turning." - Z

The spells contained in this book:
- Battering Blast
- Battering Blast (Heightened/Piercing)
- Battering Blast (Heightened/Piercing/Empowered)~

