@3014 =~Z's Spell Notes - Original - Corrupt Elements~
@3015 =~This book collects the notes of a wizard known only as Z on his own spell, Corrupt Elements. If you wish, you may learn them.

"Why did I develop this spell? Hmm... let me put it this way. On one planar trip I came to a place where even the rabbits were born immune to all elemental damage. Born immune - not protected by magic. No, don't misunderstand, I am not hinting at anything, or complaining. But think about it: if the creator has gone that mad, what is wrong with us going a little mad too?" - Z

The spells contained in this book:
- Corrupt Elemental Bomb
- Greater Corrupt Elemental Bomb~

